 the period of August 1, 2026, to July 31, 2027. Dates of each course to be determined but will fall within the Fall, Winter and Summer semesters of 2026-27. ADVG 1010     The Adventure Tourism Industry ADVG 1020     Wilderness Travel ADVG 1050     Guiding Leadership ADVG 1110     Emergency Situation and SAR Management ADVG1190     Standard Interpretive Guide Course ADVG1216    Trail Crew ADVG 1276    Business & Marketing for Adventure Operations ADVG1302    Outdoor Travel Skills ADVG1330    Backpacking ADVG1340    Introduction to Paddle Sports ADVG1350    Canoe Skills ADVG 1510     Flatwater Canoe Instructor ADVG 1530     Kayak 1 ADVG 1550     Ski 1 ADVG 1560     Ski Tour 1 ADVG 1570     Rock Climbing 1 ADVG 1580     Mountaineering 1 ADVG 1590     Avalanche 1 ADVG 1600     SRT III ADVG 2010     Natural Environment ADVG 2030     Wilderness First Aid ADVG 2040     The Business of Adventure ADVG 2060     Legal Liability and Risk Management ADVG 2070     Ocean Surfing 1 ADVG 2080     CASI Snowboard Instructor Level 1 ADVG 2200     Climbing Gym Instructor 1 ADVG2240     Top Rope Climbing Instructor ADVG 2260     Ocean Surfing 2 ADVG 2270     Ocean Surfing 3 ADVG2430     Assistant Hiking Guide ADVG 2450     Alpine Ski Instructor ADVG 2460    Swiftwater Rope Rescue ADVG 2490    Kayak 2 ADVG2500    Rock Climbing 2 - Traditional ADVG 2510    Moving Water Canoe Instructor ADVG 2530    Kayak 3 ADVG 2540    Senior River Kayak Instructor ADVG 2570    Ski Tour 2 ADVG 2620    Rope Rescue Team Member ADVG 2630    Rope Rescue Team Leader ADVG 2640    Sea Kayaking 1 ADVG 2650    Sea Kayaking 2 ADVG 2652    Sea Kayaking 3 ADVG 2660    Rafting 1 ADVG2680    IRATA Level 1 Rope Access Technician ADVG 2730    SRT 4 Swiftwater Rescue Specialist ADVG 2750    Rafting 2 ADVG 2760    Ice Climbing ADVG 2770    Adventure Sports Photography ADVG 2790    Ski Tour 3 ADVG 2800    Rock Climbing 2 ADVG 2810    Mountaineering 2 ADVG 2830    Expedition Planning and Leadership ADVG 2840    Coastal Sail 